# Acrobatic Cheerleader, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, put a flying counter on
# it. This ability triggers only once." It is cast on turn 1 and attacks on turn 3, so it is tapped at the second main phase and
# gets a flying counter. On turn 5 it attacks again and is tapped again at the second main phase: it has triggered once, so it
# gets no second counter (the flying counter is not a +1/+1 counter, so it grows no bigger either).

